        "title": "Design",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Make your prosthesis <em>bionic</em>! (Controlled by the body.)</p><p></p><p>You already know</p><ul><li>how the gripper works (the simulated gripper works basically like the demo gripper)</li><li>how to make an automatic machine.</li><li>how to connect your data to the EMG reader.</li></ul><p>Now, design a way to put it together!</p><p></p><p>We&#x27;re working with the simulation, so design a way to make a <em>bionic </em>gripper.</p>"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
